  "title": "Grandpuits Zero-crude Platform: TotalEnergies Starts Production at France’s First Advanced Plastics Recycling Plant",
  "summary": "Paris, March 19, 2026 – TotalEnergies has launched France’s first advanced plastics recycling plant, with an annual capacity of 15,000 tons, at its Grandpuits site southeast of Paris. This start-up marks another step in the conversion of the refinery into a zero-crude platform. A brand-new plastics recycling activity The new plant uses innovative recycling technology […]",
